# ROWNAA — Phase 3: Owner & Driver Registration System

> This is the supply-side of the marketplace. Every car that a customer can book originates here. The registration must be thorough, the approval flow strict, and the owner dashboard functional like a mobile app.

---

## 1. Owner Registration Entry Point

### Where It Begins
- Homepage footer link: "List Your Car on Rownaa"
- Login page: "Are you a car owner? Register your vehicle →"
- Dedicated URL: `/owner/register`

### Pre-Registration Screen
- Hero message: "Earn with your car. Verified drivers earn more."
- Two-column feature highlights: "Easy Registration" | "Secure Payments" | "6 Service Types" | "Admin Support"
- "Start Registration" CTA button → begins 7-step flow

---

## 2. The 7-Step Registration Form UI

### Progress Indicator
- Sticky at top of form: Step bar showing steps 1–7
- Current step: filled circle with number, accent color
- Completed steps: checkmark circle, green
- Future steps: empty circle, muted
- Step label shown below each circle (desktop) / just number (mobile)

### Navigation
- "Next →" button (accent) — validates current step before proceeding
- "← Back" button (ghost) — goes to previous step without losing data
- Data is stored in React state across all steps until final submit
- No partial saves to DB until Step 7 submit

---

### Step 1 — Basic Info

| Field | Type | Validation |
|---|---|---|
| Full Name / Business Name | Text input | Required, min 3 chars |
| Phone Number | Tel input | Required, 11 digits, triggers OTP verification inline |
| OTP Box | 4-digit OTP input | Required to proceed — "Verify" button |
| Email | Email input | Optional |
| Business Type | Radio cards: "Individual Owner" / "Rental Agency" | Required — affects Step 2 and Step 3 |
| Main Operating Zone | Structured area multi-select | Required (where their cars primarily operate) |

**UI Note:** After entering phone, a "Send OTP" button appears. A 60-second countdown timer shows after OTP sent. "Resend" appears after countdown. Verified = green checkmark next to phone field.

**Business Type Visual:** Two large radio cards side by side. "Individual Owner" card shows single-car icon + "1 car, driving yourself or with a driver". "Rental Agency" card shows fleet icon + "Multiple cars, rental business". Selected card gets accent border.

---

### Step 2 — Owner/Business Verification Documents

| Field | Type | Condition | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| NID Card — Front | File upload | Always required | Accept: JPG, PNG, PDF. Max 5MB |
| NID Card — Back | File upload | Always required | Same as above |
| Trade License | File upload | Required if "Rental Agency" | Hidden for Individual |
| Address Proof (Utility Bill) | File upload | Always required | |

**File Upload UI Spec:**
- Each upload slot = dashed-border box with cloud-upload icon
- States: Empty → "Click or drag to upload" | Uploading → progress bar | Done → thumbnail preview with file name + "× Remove" button
- Image files: show actual thumbnail preview
- PDF files: show PDF icon + file name
- Error (wrong type/too large): red border + error message inline

**Step 2 Note for Agencies:** If "Rental Agency" was selected in Step 1, an additional box appears for Trade License upload with a subtle callout: "Required for registered businesses."

---

### Step 3 — Car Information

**UI Header:** "Tell us about your car" + an "Add Another Car +" button (top right, for agencies)

Each car is a collapsible card section. All fields below are per-car:

| Field | Type | Validation |
|---|---|---|
| Car Name / Model | Text input (e.g. "Toyota Axio") | Required |
| Car Type | Segmented: Sedan / SUV / Microbus / Noah-Hiace | Required |
| Seat Count | Number stepper (min=2, max=20) | Required |
| Manufacturing Year | Year dropdown (2000–current year) | Optional |
| Car Color | Text input + color swatches (10 common colors selectable) | Required |
| Number Plate | Text input, uppercase enforced | Required, unique |
| Car Photos | 3 upload slots labeled: "Front View" / "Rear View" / "Interior" | Min 1 required |
| BRTA Registration Paper | File upload | Required |
| Fitness Certificate | File upload | Required |
| Fitness Certificate Expiry Date | Date picker | Required — stored in DB for auto-suspend |
| Tax Token | File upload | Required |
| Tax Token Expiry Date | Date picker | Required |
| Insurance Paper | File upload | Optional — shows "(Optional)" label |

**"Add Another Car" Logic:**
- Appears at bottom of Step 3 ONLY if "Rental Agency" was selected in Step 1
- Clicking it clones the car form section with a new "Car #2" header
- Each car section has a "Remove Car" button (except the first one)
- All cars must be individually complete before proceeding to Step 4

---

### Step 4 — Driver Information

**Header:** "Who will drive this car?"

**Toggle at top:** "I am the driver" / "I have a separate driver"

**If "I am the driver" is selected:**
- All driver fields are hidden
- A small note shows: "Your NID from Step 2 will serve as driver verification."
- "Next →" button is enabled immediately

**If "I have a separate driver" is selected:**

| Field | Type | Validation |
|---|---|---|
| Driver's Full Name | Text input | Required |
| Driver's Phone | Tel input | Required |
| Driving License — Front | File upload | Required |
| Driving License — Back | File upload | Required |
| Driver's Photo | File upload (portrait) | Required |
| Years of Experience | Number stepper (min=0) | Optional |

**For multi-car agencies:** A driver can be added per-car, or one driver can be marked as the default for all cars (a "Use for all cars" checkbox on the driver card).

**MVP Note:** Driver info is optional for MVP. Show an "I'll add driver details later" link that skips Step 4. Flag this owner account as `driver_pending`.

---

### Step 5 — Service Preference

| Field | Type | Validation |
|---|---|---|
| Services Offered | Checkbox cards: 6 service options | Required — must select exactly 1 to 3 (enforce max 3 with UI counter) |
| Availability | Radio: Full-time / Part-time / Weekend Only | Required |
| Operating Areas | Multi-select dropdown (list of districts/areas) | Required — min 1 |

**Service Checkbox Cards:**
- 6 cards in a 3×2 grid (desktop) / 2×3 grid (mobile)
- Each card: service icon + name + 1-line description
- Selected = accent border + checkmark
- Counter badge: "2/3 selected" — turns red if user tries to select 4th

---

### Step 6 — Payment / Bank Info

| Field | Type | Validation |
|---|---|---|
| bKash Number | Tel input | Required (at least one payment method) |
| Nagad Number | Tel input | Optional |
| Bank Name | Text input | Optional |
| Account Holder Name | Text input | Required if bank details entered |
| Account Number | Text input | Required if bank details entered |
| Branch Name | Text input | Optional |

**UI Note:** bKash number is required. Bank details section is collapsible, labeled "Add Bank Account (Optional)". If expanded, account holder name and account number become required.

---

### Step 7 — Review & Submit

- Full summary of all entered data displayed in read-only sections
- Each section has an "Edit" link that navigates back to that specific step
- Checkbox: "I confirm all information provided is accurate and genuine."
- "Submit Application" button (accent, full-width)

**On Submit:**
1. POST `/api/owners/register` with all accumulated data (including all file upload URLs from Cloudinary)
2. Business record created with `status = 'pending'`
3. Notification sent to admin panel
4. Customer sees "Application Submitted!" success screen
5. Screen shows: "We'll review your documents within 24–48 hours. You'll receive an SMS once approved."

---

## 3. Approval Notification Flow

### On Approval (Admin triggers):
- `businesses.status` updated to `'approved'`
- SMS sent to owner phone: "Congratulations! Your Rownaa registration has been approved. You can now log in and start receiving bookings."
- Email sent (if email provided)
- Owner's cars remain in `pending` status until each is individually approved (two-layer, see Phase 4)

### On Rejection (Admin triggers):
- `businesses.status` updated to `'rejected'`, `rejection_reason` field filled
- SMS: "Your Rownaa registration was not approved. Reason: [reason]. Please resubmit with correct documents."
- Owner can log in, see rejection reason, re-upload documents, and resubmit

---

## 4. Owner Dashboard (After Approval)

### Dashboard Layout (Desktop)
- Left sidebar: Logo | Dashboard | Bookings | My Cars | Earnings | Profile | Logout
- Main content area: changes per section

### Dashboard Layout (Mobile) — App-Like
- Full-screen content area
- Bottom navigation bar (fixed): Home icon | Bookings icon | Cars icon | Earnings icon | Profile icon
- No sidebar on mobile. Each section is full-screen page transition (slide left/right animation)

---

### Dashboard Home Tab
- Welcome banner: "Hello, [Name]. Your account is Active."
- KPI row (3 cards): "New Requests" | "Active Bookings" | "Net Earnings This Month"
- Section: Recent booking requests (last 5) with Accept/Reject buttons
- Section: Expiry alerts — red alert card if any fitness cert expires within 30 days

---

### Bookings Tab

**Tab sub-nav:** New Requests | Upcoming | History

#### New Requests
- List of `pending` bookings assigned to this owner's cars
- Each card: Service type | Pickup location | Date & Time | Passenger count | Customer name
- Two buttons: "Accept" (green) | "Reject" (red)
- Accept → booking status moves to `confirmed`, customer gets SMS
- Reject → booking goes back to `pending` in admin panel for reassignment

#### Upcoming Bookings
- List of `confirmed` bookings
- Each card: Same info + "Start Trip" button
- "Start Trip" → `PATCH /api/bookings/:id/start-trip` → status = `ongoing`, records `trip_started_at`

#### Ongoing Bookings
- Active trip card: prominent, with "End Trip" button
- "End Trip" → modal appears: "Enter Final Bill Amount" + "Payment Received" confirmation → `PATCH /api/bookings/:id/end-trip`

#### History
- List of `completed` and `cancelled` bookings — read-only

---

### My Cars Tab

- List of all cars under this business
- Each car card: photo | model | plate | status badge | seats | type
- Toggle switch: "Available / Unavailable" — `PATCH /api/cars/:id/availability`
- "Edit Details" button → edit car info form (pre-filled)
- "Update Document" button → individual document re-upload (e.g. new fitness cert)
- Status display: Active / Inactive / Suspended (with reason if suspended)

---

### Earnings Tab

**KPI cards:**
- Total Earned (all time)
- This Month's Earnings
- Commission Deducted (10% total)
- Net Payable

**Earnings Table:**
- Columns: Date | Booking ID | Service | Total Amount | Commission | Net
- Filter by: This week / This month / Date range

---

### Profile Tab

- Edit basic info (name, email, operating zone)
- Re-upload verification documents
- Change bKash / bank info
- "Change Password" option (if email login set up)
